FEED MossyMage takes the oath as an elf mage (out of the old woods past the fields; sees in the dark). Hits hardest. Dies hardest.
FEED DawnCleric takes the oath as a human cleric (valley-born, like most of Bellmire). Keeps the party upright longer than it deserves.
FEED BigAxe takes the oath as an orc barbarian (came over the west road and stayed; sees in the dark). The most meat. Swings heavy, guards nothing.
FEED Wren takes the oath as a halfling bard (from the field-farms; a natural 1 is rolled again). Sings the party steady. Everyone swings truer while they stand.
FEED OakenShield takes the oath as a dwarf paladin (down from the hill mines; sees in the dark). Lays hands on the fallen, and hits the dead twice as hard.
